This package is a pure-Python compatibility shim for the renamed seekdb
package. It contains no third-party code of its own and is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Its only runtime dependency is the seekdb wheel, which ships the complete
third-party component inventory, license texts and redistribution
requirements under seekdb/licenses/.
